--- !u!114 &1007678682
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1007678680}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7941f4e33b300df4abbe2e0c8dd3b21f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoreManager
  lorePanels:
  - {fileID: 558125892}
  - {fileID: 775308258}
  - {fileID: 402798223}
  loreTexts:
  - {fileID: 687582876}
  - {fileID: 1284480388}
  - {fileID: 949472159}
  typeSpeed: 0.03
  lorePaper1: '8 January, 2006

    Patient N is completely lost. He keeps whispering
    under his breath about some kind of spin. Freak! Glad I''m quiting this job and
    I don''t need face him again.

    Security guardian,

    Joseph"'
  lorePaper2: "2 June 2005,\r\n I'm afraid to say patient N can't be cured.  The
    \u25A1.\u25A1.\u25A1.\u25A1. went too deep in his mind. If nothing changes, we
    should take him to Sector A\r\n\r\nDoctor in charge of the sector,\r\nJerome\""
  lorePaper3: "16 February 2005,\r\nHi... It's my \u25A1\u25A1st day \u25A1\u25A1r\u25A1.
    Doc\u25A1\u25A1\u25A1 adviced \u25A1\u25A1 to make daily \u25A1\u25A1\u25A1\u25A1s.
    So, h\u25A1r\u25A1 we are. \u25A1\u25A1\u25A1 people so scary \u25A1\u25A1\u25A1
    I \u25A1\u25A1\u25A1\u25A1 they could be j\u25A1st like \u25A1\u25A1\u25A1\u25A1
    pie\u25A1\u25A1 \u25A1\u25A1 paper\r\nPatient N,\r\nEthan"
  activePanelIndex: -1
